1467 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Glyph Gnomes are believed to be more connected to the mysterious realm of the Fey than the other Gnome subraces\056 These mystical tricksters are abundant throughout most of the moderate and warmer climates of Pliara\054 and they are known to enjoy long adventures\054 exploration\054 and trade\056 It is extremely common to see a Glyph Gnome as a merchant\054 peddling strange oddities and antiques\056\n\nGlyph Gnomes are often wildly colored with well\055styled hair\056 Purple\054 green\054 or even blue\055skinned Glyph Gnomes are just as common as those of other colors\056 Each Glyph Gnome has a small glyph on their skin resembling a birthmark\054 which cannot be removed under any circumstances\056 Removing the skin in which the glyph is found will cause it to appear on another part of the body the following day\054 so long as the Glyph Gnome remains alive\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1468 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1468 0 obj
  << /K [ 1467 0 R ]
     /P 1473 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1469 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Wisdom score increases by 1\056\nRuned Skin\056 Every Glyph Gnome has at least one rune somewhere on their skin\056 For some\054 these runes may be small and easily hidden\056 For others\054 runes could trace the lengths of their arms and legs\056\nWhen creating a Glyph Gnome\054 you should carefully determine the size\054 position\054 and appearance of your runes\054 as these typically do not change\056 There are few limitations to the runes\047 appearance\056 Battle Runes could consist of a giant sword across the Gnome\047s back\054 two crossed axes on their shoulder\054 or even a fist on their forehead\056 Work with your Game Master if you believe your idea may be too outlandish \050but Gnomes love outlandish\041\051\056\nChoose one category of rune from the list below\056 At level 12\054 you gain a new rune from the below list that will appear on your body in a manner of your or your GM\047s discretion\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1470 0 R
     /Pg 818 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

