1478 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Rock Gnomes are the most common Gnomish subrace in Pliara\054 easily outnumbering their kin across the continent\056 Hearty and intelligent\054 they rely on quick thinking and a surprisingly tough build to navigate the world around them\056 Unlike other Gnomes who sport vibrant hues\054 Rock Gnomes feature milder skin and hair tones\056 Their appearances range from pale browns and soft blues to gentle pinks\056 They possess an innate hardiness that lets them thrive in demanding environments\054 alongside a natural talent for invention that surpasses all other Gnomish bloodlines\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1479 0 R
     /Pg 1460 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

