     /Pg 1460 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1480 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution score increases by 1\056\nArtificer\047s Lore\056 Whenever you make an Intelligence \050History\051 check related to magic items\054 alchemical objects\054 or technological devices\054 you add twice your proficiency bonus\054 instead of any proficiency bonus you normally apply\056\nTinker\056You gain proficiency with tinker\047s tools\056 Using those tools\054 you can spend 1 hour and 10 gold pieces worth of materials to construct a Tiny clockwork device with an Armor Class of 5 and 1 hit point\056 The device ceases to function after 24 hours\054 though you can spend 1 hour repairing it to extend its life by another 24 hours\056 You can also use your action to dismantle it and reclaim the original materials\056 You can have up to three such devices active at one time\056 When you create a device\054 choose one of the following options\072\nClockwork Toy\072 This toy represents a clockwork animal\054 monster\054 or person\056 When placed on the ground\054 it moves 5 feet across the floor on each of your turns in a random direction while making noises appropriate to the creature it depicts\056\nFire Starter\072 The device produces a miniature flame that you can use to light a candle\054 torch\054 or campfire\056 Using the device requires your action\056\nMusic Box\072 When opened\054 this music box plays a single song at a moderate volume\056 The box stops playing when it reaches the end of the song or when it is closed\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1481 0 R
     /Pg 1460 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

