1484 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The harshest land on all of Pliara\054 the Tundwine\054 is home to very few flora or fauna\056 Life in the Tundwine is difficult as sub zero temperatures\054 devastating wind storms\054 and an overall horrid environment make it nearly inhospitable\056\n\nNearly\056 Some\054 such as the Tundwine Gnomes\054 thrive in the frozen wastelands\056 With skin tones ranging from light grays to dark blues\054 these magical Gnomes break tradition by forming their own colonies and small civilizations throughout the Tundwine\054 associating with few other creatures\056 Despite being the only other civilized race\054 Frost Elves and Tundwine Gnomes generally do not get along with one another and pose great conflict\056\n\nWhile tales of other forms of Gnomes are told throughout the Tundwine\054 many feel these tales to be folklore and do not believe in the existence of other Gnomes\056 Those who do believe in \050or discover\051 other Gnomes will often find their wild behavior and outrageous personalities far too overwhelming\054 as Tundwine Gnomes are often far more quiet\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1485 0 R
     /Pg 1460 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

