  >>
endobj

1486 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution score increases by 1\056\nTemperature Regulation\056 Long\054 thick hair covering the Tundwine Gnome\047s body protects it from the sub\055zero temperatures of the tundra\073 however\054 this hair will quickly shrink away when exposed to warmer climates\056 In a hot enough climate\054 the Tundwine Gnome may even appear completely hairless\056\nHide Underground\056 Tundwine Gnomes dig shelters in softer ground or powder to escape the sudden storms and natural environment of Tundwine\056 Once per long rest\054 you can use a bonus action to gain a Burrow Speed of 10 ft\056\nNever Bothered Me\056 You have resistance to Cold damage\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1487 0 R
     /Pg 1460 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

