1492 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Among the smallest of the common races on Pliara\054 Gnomes stand an average of two\055and\055a\055half to three feet tall\056 More often than not\054 Gnomes will train to use their small stature to their advantage\054 despite their cumbersome restrictions on movement\056 Whenever necessary\054 a Gnome will resort to cunning and wits to turn the tables on an otherwise dire situation\056\n\nWhile Gnomes are known for being one of the smallest\054 squattest common races of Pliara\054 they are also very well\055known for their broad spectrum of coloration\056 Though some Gnomish colorations are more uncommon than others\054 no color known seems impossible to be seen on Gnomish skin and hair\056 Some Gnomes will invest in cosmetics to appear more \042normal\054\042 while others may use the same cosmetics to further their wild appearance\056 Tundwine Gnomes\054 with pale blue skin and white hair\054 pose a stark contrast to the vibrancy of their counterparts\056\n\nGnomes love to travel\073 their wild hearts and wanderlust make them natural explorers\056 Although it is extremely rare to see entire kingdoms\054 cities\054 or even towns of Gnomes\054 it is quite common to see families or single Gnomes residing among other races\056 Older Gnomes will often become entertainers\054 storytellers\054 merchants\054 or even Guild Advisors\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1493 0 R
     /Pg 1462 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

