  >>
endobj

1494 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Intelligence Score increases by 2\nAge\056 Gnomes mature at the same rate humans do\054 and most are expected to settle down into an adult life by around age 40\056 They can live 350 to almost 500 years\056\nAlignment\056 Gnomes are most often good\056 Those who tend toward law are sages\054 engineers\054 researchers\054 scholars\054 investigators\054 or inventors\056 Those who tend toward chaos are minstrels\054 tricksters\054 wanderers\054 or fanciful jewelers\056 Gnomes are good\055hearted\054 and even the tricksters among them are more playful than vicious\056\nSize\056 Gnomes are between 3 and 4 feet tall and average about 40 pounds\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 25 feet\056\nDarkvision\056 You have superior vision in dark and dim conditions\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You cannot discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nGnome Cunning\056 You have advantage on all Intelligence\054 Wisdom\054 and Charisma saving throws against magic\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Common and Gnomish\056 The Gnomish language\054 which uses the Dwarvish script\054 is renowned for its technical treatises and its catalogs of knowledge about the natural world\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1495 0 R
     /Pg 1462 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

